Z||000000||jhar1987||04-24-2001||06:47 PM||||this is a good one if the forum can help with this one you can truly call yourselves "FIERO GODS". after driving for 5 min. or so my v6 auto shuts off! after cranking for say 30 sec. she fires back up and away we go. it did it tonite 4 times in 30 min. i had this prob.last week so i changed bat.,alt.,starter, cables thought i had it till today. WHAT THE H*LL IS GOING ON?? thanks i will be holding up trafic waiting for an answer. jeff||||reg||1
Z||000001||operator64||04-24-2001||06:52 PM||||   Sounds like a fuel pump problem, start with the relay and the oil pressure sending unit.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000002||theogre||04-24-2001||06:55 PM||||check the big connector block by the battery and all the battery cables.<P>ignition's a good posibility too.||||reg||1
